          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yoshua wakalekesha buloba bujima, ne bua ku mikuna, ne bua ku Sude, ne bua mu bibanda, ne bua ku tukunakuna, ne bakelenge babu bonso: kakashiya nansha umue, wakabutula bonso bakadi ne muoyo, bu muakamba Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua wakabashiha ku Kadeshe-bânea tô ne ku Gaza, ne ba mu buloba buonso bua Goshena tô ne ku Gibeona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakelenge aba bonso ne buloba buabo buonso Yoshua wakanyenga musangu umue, bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, wakadila Bena Isalele nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua wakahingana, ne Bena Isalele bonso, ku tshitudilu tshia ku Gilegala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
